      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stafford%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Stafford sits near the site where Pocahontas was abducted by Captain Samuel Argall in 1613, an event tied to early colonial history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stafford%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Stafford hosts the Patawomeck Museum & Cultural Center, preserving the heritage of the Patawomeck and Manahoac tribes.",
